{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792160/extras/68e28ccb1842230af0014afa66e8b7be.avif?t=1769794475\" width=257 height=351 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SPHEROCIOUS is a short but sweet, handcrafted 2.5D puzzle platformer about a sloth and a renegade scientist saving the Amazon rainforest from a greedy logging corporation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who This Game is For</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of adventure, mystery, and dystopian comedy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792160/extras/21e3a30115f42f8818eb7878aea97538.avif?t=1769794475\" width=1560 height=780 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crawl</strong>, <strong>jump</strong>, and <strong>roll</strong> your way through the jungle while <strong>solving ancient puzzles</strong> and <strong>battling advanced forestry bots</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time your moves strategically, because you need to manage your <strong>stamina</strong>. Every movement (<strong>crawling, jumping, inflating</strong>) uses some of your stamina, but it recharges with time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your<strong>\u00a0bot</strong> assistant can <strong>launch</strong> you through the air and water or <strong>boost</strong> you on the ground, so <strong>alternate</strong> between using it and your own movement abilities to find the most efficient path forward</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take matters into your own claws </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792160/extras/21e3a30115f42f8818eb7878aea97538.avif?t=1769794475\" width=1560 height=780 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>After having underwent an experimental genetic modification process, a sloth gains sudden clarity about its habitat.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the help of a lone biologist, it harnesses a lost civilization's power source in order to uncover the truth about an invasive forestry operation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792160/extras/8160d3b5dbf7891cfbe2170a90cf5f1c.avif?t=1769794475\" width=257 height=273 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1792160?t=1769794475","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792160/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769794475","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792160/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769794475","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792160/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769794475","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Commentary available","id":14},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>About Iwa Interactive</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792160/extras/0f20cce438223dcb88352e76490dcf21.avif?t=1769794475\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792160/extras_big/0f20cce438223dcb88352e76490dcf21.webp?t=1769794475 width=1560 height=790 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Iwa Interactive is a Canadian game studio with the aim to improve the modern gaming scene by leveraging core values that made games of the past truly <strong>fun</strong>.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">One of the primary goals of the company is to bring a <strong>gaming renaissance</strong> while sticking to ethical principles.</h2></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792160/extras/68e28ccb1842230af0014afa66e8b7be.avif?t=1769794475\" width=257 height=351 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SPHEROCIOUS is a short but sweet, handcrafted 2.5D puzzle platformer about a sloth and a renegade scientist saving the Amazon rainforest from a greedy logging corporation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who This Game is For</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of adventure, mystery, and dystopian comedy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792160/extras/21e3a30115f42f8818eb7878aea97538.avif?t=1769794475\" width=1560 height=780 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crawl</strong>, <strong>jump</strong>, and <strong>roll</strong> your way through the jungle while <strong>solving ancient puzzles</strong> and <strong>battling advanced forestry bots</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time your moves strategically, because you need to manage your <strong>stamina</strong>. Every movement (<strong>crawling, jumping, inflating</strong>) uses some of your stamina, but it recharges with time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your<strong>\u00a0bot</strong> assistant can <strong>launch</strong> you through the air and water or <strong>boost</strong> you on the ground, so <strong>alternate</strong> between using it and your own movement abilities to find the most efficient path forward</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take matters into your own claws </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792160/extras/21e3a30115f42f8818eb7878aea97538.avif?t=1769794475\" width=1560 height=780 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>After having underwent an experimental genetic modification process, a sloth gains sudden clarity about its habitat.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the help of a lone biologist, it harnesses a lost civilization's power source in order to uncover the truth about an invasive forestry operation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792160/extras/8160d3b5dbf7891cfbe2170a90cf5f1c.avif?t=1769794475\" width=257 height=273 /></span></p>","developers":["Iwa Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792160/header.jpg?t=1769794475","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1792160/1746384455/879c3663301a1e03b9a3d98b5956